# T7a follow-up D7: two ways out of Classic. HOME on X0X's SONG page leaves Classic, and the GLOBAL
# list's "BACK TO SONG" row does too (same all-off handoff), and the Classic footer hints at it.
wait 300
# path 1: GLOBAL -> Classic patterns, then GLOBAL -> BACK TO SONG (the last row)
tap GLO
tap SEL
expect classic 1
expect view 1
wait 1400
shot studio_classic_footer.png
tap GLO
turn SELECT 18
wait 100
tap SEL
expect classic 0
expect view 10
# path 2: HOME on X0X's SONG page
tap GLO
tap SEL
expect classic 1
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect view 6
tap HOME
expect classic 0
expect view 10
wait 1400
shot studio_classic_exit.png
dump studio_classic_exit.json
